docs/adr/ADR-005-country-terms-and-simulated-payment.md:39:1. The quote feature owns one attempt state per country. A single Pay command checks the live editable Summary prerequisites, consent and absence of a busy or completed payment. It synchronously reserves an attempt before requesting fresh country Terms. That reservation locks submission during both the refresh and the simulation. The attempt captures the country, active Summary generation, consent binding and the selected demo outcome.
